OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal after stabbing at
OL,4,Arailway station
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have appealed for information
OL,7,Fafter a man was stabbed at a railway
OL,8,Fstation in East Sussex.
OL,10,FThe man, in his 40s, was stabbed at
OL,11,FPortslade railway station shortly
OL,12,Fbefore 19.20 BST on Thursday.
OL,14,FHe was reportedly injured during an
OL,15,Faltercation outside the station
OL,16,Finvolving four men and two women.
OL,18,FThe victim was treated for a single
OL,19,Fstab wound at hospital and is in a
OL,20,Fstable condition.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
